<given-names>BA</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Han</surname>
<given-names>YY</given-names></string-name>, et al. <article-title>Mortality and functional morbidity after use of PALS/APLS by community physicians</article-title>. <source><italic toggle="yes">Pediatrics</italic></source>. <year>2009</year>;<volume>124</volume>:<fpage>500</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>508</lpage>. doi:<pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1542/peds.2008-1967</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19651576</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="CIT0002"><label>2.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Balamuth</surname>
